@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Warehouse Planner" as PLANNER
participant ":System" as System
participant "WMS" as WMS

activate PLANNER

PLANNER -> System : requests order eligibility & allocation (orders.csv, order_lines.csv)
activate System
System --> PLANNER : confirms orders successfully loaded

System -> WMS : loads current inventory (boxes, bays, expiry dates)
activate WMS
WMS --> System : returns stock data organized by SKU and FEFO/FIFO order
deactivate WMS

System -> WMS : processes orders by priority, dueDate, orderId
activate WMS
note right
  Within each order:
  • Lines sorted by lineNo ASC
  • Allocation walks boxes in FEFO/FIFO order
  • allocate = min(remainingQty, box.qtyAvailable)
  • reduce remainingQty until satisfied or no stock
end note
WMS --> System : returns allocation fragments (orderId, lineNo, boxId, qty, bay)
deactivate WMS

System -> WMS : evaluate eligibility mode (strict / partial)
activate WMS
note right
  Modes:
  • strict → full quantity required (else UNDISPATCHABLE)
  • partial → keep partial allocations
end note
WMS --> System : returns per-line eligibility (ELIGIBLE, PARTIAL, UNDISPATCHABLE)
deactivate WMS

System --> PLANNER : displays eligibility report and allocation list
deactivate System
deactivate PLANNER

@enduml
